  "title": "Burn",
  "markdown": "# Burn\n\n![Visual reference from Burn](../../assets/figures/page-0111-visual.webp)\n\n## Rule of 9's Estimation of Burned Body Surface (Percent)\n\n### Adult (Back)\n* Head: 4.5%\n* Torso: 18%\n* Left Arm: 4.5%\n* Right Arm: 4.5%\n* Left Leg: 9%\n* Right Leg: 9%\n\n### Adult (Front)\n* Head: 4.5%\n* Torso: 18%\n* Left Arm: 4.5%\n* Right Arm: 4.5%\n* Perineum: 1%\n* Left Leg: 9%\n* Right Leg: 9%\n\n### Infant (Back)\n* Head: 9%\n* Left Arm: 4.5%\n* Right Arm: 4.5%\n* Torso: 13%\n* Left Buttock: 2.5%\n* Right Buttock: 2.5%\n* Left Leg: 7%\n* Right Leg: 7%\n\n### Infant (Front)\n* Head: 9%\n* Left Arm: 4.5%\n* Right Arm: 4.5%\n* Torso: 18%\n* Left Leg: 7%\n* Right Leg: 7%\n\n**Remember:** The patient's hand (palm PLUS fingers) is about 1% of the patient's body surface area.\n",
